	"description": [
		"This class aims to better understand the racial climate in the United States, and the implications for American politics. Differing analytical perspectives from political science are used to interpret the role of race. A central question is the degree to which \"post-racial\" is an appropriate description of the current era. Counts toward race and ethnic studies major and concentration."
